// PLC tag table "pnioDev" — the pnio-dev process image (sample config: 16 REAL + 32
// BOOL per direction; device view: in1 %I0..63, in2 %I64..67, out3 %Q0..63, out4 %Q64..67).
// TIA cannot import this as a source: create a tag table "pnioDev" and paste the three
// columns (Name / Data type / Address), or keep only the tags the experiment uses
// (marked *). Device point of view: "devIn_*" = data the DEVICE produces (CPU %I),
// "devOut_*" = data the CPU produces (device consumes, CPU %Q).
//
// Name             Data type   Address    Comment
// devIn_Counter*   DWord       %ID0       edge cycle counter (raw bits of in1 REAL 0)
